{"id":"u11","kelas":8,"no":2,"judul":"Yang Sedang Terjadi","title":"What Are You Doing?","emoji":"🏃","ringkas":"Present continuous tense dan perbedaannya dengan simple present","ready":true,"goals":["menceritakan hal yang **sedang terjadi sekarang** dengan present continuous","membentuk kalimat dengan [[am / is / are]] + kata kerja-**ing**","membuat kalimat negatif dan pertanyaan present continuous","membedakan **simple present** (kebiasaan) dan **present continuous** (sedang terjadi)","memakai kata petunjuk: [[now]], [[at the moment]], [[right now]], [[Look!]], [[Listen!]]"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Bayangkan temanmu menelepon dan bertanya, \"Kamu **sedang apa**?\" Kamu menjawab, \"Aku **sedang** belajar.\" Dalam bahasa Inggris, kata \"sedang\" dibentuk dengan **present continuous tense**. Itulah topik **Unit 2**."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Rumus present continuous","text":"Rumusnya: **am / is / are + kata kerja-ing**. Kamu sudah kenal keduanya, to be (Kelas 7, Unit 2) dan -ing (Kelas 7, Unit 7).","table":[["Subjek","To be","Contoh"],["I","**am**","[[I am reading a book.]] (I'm reading)"],["he / she / it","**is**","[[She is cooking dinner.]] (She's cooking)"],["you / we / they","**are**","[[They are playing football.]] (They're playing)"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Aturan menambah -ing","table":[["Aturan","Contoh"],["Biasanya tambah **-ing**","read → reading, eat → eating, play → playing"],["Berakhiran **e** → hilangkan e","write → writing, make → making, dance → dancing"],["Satu suku kata, konsonan-vokal-konsonan → gandakan konsonan","run → running, swim → swimming, sit → sitting, get → getting"],["Berakhiran **ie** → ganti dengan **y** + ing","lie → lying, die → dying"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Negatif dan pertanyaan","table":[["Jenis","Pola","Contoh"],["Negatif","to be + **not** + kata kerja-ing","[[I am not sleeping.]] / [[He isn't watching TV.]] / [[They aren't studying.]]"],["Pertanyaan","To be + subjek + kata kerja-ing?","[[Are you listening?]] / [[Is she cooking?]]"],["Jawaban","Yes, I am. / No, she isn't.",""]],"examples":[{"en":"[[What are you doing?]] — [[I'm doing my homework.]]","id":"Kamu sedang apa? — Aku sedang mengerjakan PR."},{"en":"[[Where is he going?]] — [[He's going to school.]]","id":"Dia mau ke mana? — Dia pergi ke sekolah."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Kata penunjuk waktu","text":"Kata-kata ini sering muncul bersama present continuous:","table":[["Kata","Artinya","Contoh"],["[[now]] / [[right now]]","sekarang / saat ini juga","[[I am studying now.]]"],["[[at the moment]]","saat ini","[[She is cooking at the moment.]]"],["[[today]] / [[this week]]","hari ini / minggu ini (sementara)","[[I'm staying at my uncle's house this week.]]"],["[[Look!]] / [[Listen!]]","Lihat! / Dengar!","[[Look! It is raining.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Simple present atau present continuous?","text":"Ini perbedaan yang paling sering membingungkan. Bandingkan dua kalimat berikut:","table":[["","Simple present","Present continuous"],["**Untuk**","kebiasaan dan fakta","kegiatan yang sedang berlangsung"],["**Contoh**","[[I brush my teeth every morning.]]","[[I am brushing my teeth now.]]"],["**Kata petunjuk**","always, usually, every day, never","now, at the moment, Look!, Listen!"],["**Pertanyaan**","Do you play football?","Are you playing football?"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara cepat memilih","text":"Tanya dirimu: **apakah ini terjadi sekarang juga?** Jika ya → present continuous. Jika ini kebiasaan atau fakta → simple present."},{"t":"warn","title":"Kata kerja yang tidak dipakai dengan -ing","text":"Beberapa kata kerja menyatakan **keadaan**, bukan kegiatan, jadi biasanya tidak dipakai dalam bentuk -ing: **like, love, want, know, understand, need**. Benar: [[I like this song.]] Salah: *I am liking this song.*"},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Telepon dengan teman","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Hi, Rani! What are you doing?","id":"Hai, Rani! Kamu sedang apa?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"I'm doing my homework. And you?","id":"Aku sedang mengerjakan PR. Kalau kamu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"I'm watching a movie with my brother. Are you studying alone?","id":"Aku sedang menonton film dengan adikku. Apakah kamu belajar sendirian?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"No, I'm not. My cousin is helping me.","id":"Tidak. Sepupuku sedang membantuku."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Good luck! Call me later.","id":"Semoga berhasil! Telepon aku nanti."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Present continuous = **am/is/are + kata kerja-ing** untuk hal yang **sedang terjadi**.","Negatif: [[am not / isn't / aren't]] + kata kerja-ing. Pertanyaan: [[Am / Is / Are]] + subjek + kata kerja-ing?","Aturan -ing: [[write → writing]], [[run → running]], [[lie → lying]].","Kata petunjuk: [[now]], [[at the moment]], [[Look!]], [[Listen!]].","Kebiasaan → simple present. Sedang terjadi → present continuous. Kata kerja keadaan (like, know) tidak pakai -ing."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata kerja dengan bentuk -ing:","pairs":[["write","writing"],["run","running"],["swim","swimming"],["dance","dancing"],["play","playing"]],"exp":"Hilangkan e (write → writing); gandakan konsonan (run → running).","k":"8ece7063"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku sedang membaca buku.","q":"I ___ reading a book. (am/is/are)","answers":["am"],"hint":"I → ...","exp":"I + am + kata kerja-ing.","k":"710d5ddd"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sedang memasak.","q":"She ___ cooking.","answers":["is"],"hint":"she → ...","exp":"She + is + kata kerja-ing.","k":"91edc9bd"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka sedang bermain di taman.","q":"They ___ playing in the park.","answers":["are"],"hint":"they → ...","exp":"They + are + kata kerja-ing.","k":"8aaa90cf"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sedang menulis surat.","q":"He is ___ a letter. (write)","answers":["writing"],"hint":"write → writ + ing","exp":"Hilangkan e: writing.","k":"8b101e68"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka sedang berlari.","q":"They are ___. (run)","answers":["running"],"hint":"run → runn + ing","exp":"Gandakan n: running.","k":"972a5c1e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She cooking now.","She is cooking now.","She cooks now.","She are cooking now."],"answer":1,"exp":"Sedang terjadi: is + kata kerja-ing.","k":"c1479d99"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat negatif yang benar.","options":["I am not sleeping.","I not sleeping.","I don't sleeping.","I am no sleeping."],"answer":0,"exp":"am not + kata kerja-ing.","k":"598c0e7e"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia sedang tidak menonton TV.\"","answer":"He isn't watching TV.","exp":"Subjek + isn't + kata kerja-ing.","k":"19e1f67c"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apa yang sedang kamu lakukan?\"","answer":"What are you doing?","exp":"What + are + you + doing?","k":"e4253959"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban singkat untuk \"Are you listening?\" (ya) adalah...","options":["Yes, I do.","Yes, I am.","Yes, I listening.","Yes, I'm not."],"answer":1,"exp":"Are you ...? → Yes, I am.","k":"d59ff016"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang berarti \"kebiasaan\"?","options":["I'm studying now.","I study every night.","She is cooking now.","Look! It is raining."],"answer":1,"exp":"every night = kebiasaan → simple present.","k":"dfb5fb78"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang memakai present continuous dengan benar?","options":["Listen! The baby cries.","Listen! The baby is crying.","Listen! The baby cry.","Listen! The baby crying."],"answer":1,"exp":"Listen! menandakan sedang terjadi → is crying.","k":"0dc69ec6"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang sedang dilakukan?","say":"She is washing the dishes","options":["Dia sedang mencuci piring","Dia sedang memasak","Dia mencuci piring setiap hari","Dia sedang membaca"],"answer":0,"exp":"is washing = sedang mencuci.","k":"a8a93ea6"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa pertanyaannya?","say":"Are they playing football","options":["Apakah mereka sedang bermain sepak bola?","Apakah mereka suka sepak bola?","Kapan mereka bermain?","Siapa yang bermain sepak bola?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Are they playing...? = Apakah mereka sedang bermain...?","k":"d521e429"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih yang benar.","options":["I am wanting a drink.","I want a drink.","I wanting a drink.","I am want a drink."],"answer":1,"exp":"want adalah kata kerja keadaan, tidak pakai -ing.","k":"c5603f10"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata kerja dengan bentuk -ing:","pairs":[["come","coming"],["sit","sitting"],["get","getting"],["lie","lying"],["study","studying"]],"exp":"come → coming (hilangkan e); sit → sitting.","k":"f6916f39"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata petunjuk dengan tense:","pairs":[["now","present continuous"],["every day","simple present"],["last week","simple past"],["tomorrow","future"]],"exp":"Petunjuk waktu menentukan tense.","k":"32d9bc5a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["He is reading a comic.","He reading a comic.","He are reading a comic.","He reads a comic now."],"answer":0,"exp":"He + is + kata kerja-ing.","k":"eca68291"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["We are waiting for the bus.","We is waiting for the bus.","We waiting for the bus.","We are wait for the bus."],"answer":0,"exp":"We + are + waiting.","k":"492417e2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I am not sleeping.","I'm no sleeping.","I not am sleeping.","I amn't sleeping."],"answer":0,"exp":"am not + kata kerja-ing.","k":"e74b398c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["Is she cooking?","She is cooking?","Does she cooking?","Are she cooking?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Is + she + kata kerja-ing?","k":"7e42270b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["What are they doing?","What they are doing?","What do they doing?","What is they doing?"],"answer":0,"exp":"What + are + they + doing?","k":"69f8fa07"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Listen! Somebody is singing.","Listen! Somebody sings now.","Listen! Somebody sing.","Listen! Somebody singing."],"answer":0,"exp":"Listen! → sedang → is singing.","k":"5fe24d18"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang menunjukkan kebiasaan?","options":["She goes to school by bus.","She is going to school now.","She is taking a bus.","Look! She is running."],"answer":0,"exp":"Kebiasaan → simple present.","k":"3d1940d1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata kerja mana yang biasanya TIDAK memakai -ing?","options":["know","run","play","write"],"answer":0,"exp":"know adalah kata kerja keadaan.","k":"2f1713bf"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sedang menonton TV.","q":"He is ___ TV. (watch)","answers":["watching"],"hint":"watch + ing","exp":"watching.","k":"7eaaab54"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami sedang bermain di halaman.","q":"We are ___ in the yard. (play)","answers":["playing"],"hint":"play + ing","exp":"playing.","k":"1bf35be1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ibu sedang membuat kue.","q":"Mom is ___ a cake. (make)","answers":["making"],"hint":"make → mak + ing","exp":"making.","k":"578b210d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka sedang berenang.","q":"They are ___. (swim)","answers":["swimming"],"hint":"swim → swimm + ing","exp":"swimming.","k":"8d8f6c22"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sedang tidak makan.","q":"She ___ eating.","answers":["isn't","is not"],"hint":"isn't","exp":"She → isn't.","k":"50512094"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku sedang mengerjakan PR.\"","answer":"I am doing my homework.","exp":"I am + doing + my homework.","k":"70e0bd83"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Mereka sedang tidak belajar.\"","answer":"They aren't studying.","exp":"They + aren't + kata kerja-ing.","k":"319f1588"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apakah kamu sedang mendengarkan?\"","answer":"Are you listening?","exp":"Are + you + kata kerja-ing?","k":"11152ff5"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang sedang terjadi?","say":"It is raining now","options":["Sedang hujan sekarang","Hujan kemarin","Akan hujan besok","Tidak hujan"],"answer":0,"exp":"is raining = sedang hujan.","k":"6971726e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang dia lakukan?","say":"She is cooking dinner for her family","options":["Memasak makan malam untuk keluarga","Makan malam bersama keluarga","Membeli makan malam","Tidur"],"answer":0,"exp":"is cooking = sedang memasak.","k":"ebfd6e6b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"It's Saturday morning. My father is washing his car. My mother is cooking in the kitchen. I am playing with my cat.\" Siapa yang sedang memasak?","options":["Ibu","Ayah","Penulis","Kucing"],"answer":0,"exp":"My mother is cooking.","k":"1d78cbee"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Look! The children are playing in the rain. They are laughing.\" Apa yang sedang dilakukan anak-anak?","options":["Bermain di bawah hujan","Belajar di kelas","Tidur","Makan siang"],"answer":0,"exp":"playing in the rain.","k":"7fb88ec8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Rani is in the library now. She is reading a novel. She isn't using her phone.\" Apa yang tidak dilakukan Rani?","options":["Memakai ponsel","Membaca novel","Berada di perpustakaan","Duduk"],"answer":0,"exp":"isn't using her phone.","k":"7ae1ec00"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Where are you going?\" B: \"___\"","options":["I'm going to the market.","I go to the market every day.","I went to the market.","I will went to the market."],"answer":0,"exp":"sedang → going.","k":"d7d8b1c1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Are they studying?\" B: \"No, they ___. They are playing.\"","options":["aren't","don't","isn't","weren't"],"answer":0,"exp":"Are they ...? → No, they aren't.","k":"0505d8ef"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["She is cook now.","She is cooking now.","She cooks every day.","She isn't cooking."],"answer":0,"exp":"is cooking.","k":"4642a65d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["They is playing.","They are playing.","He is playing.","I am playing."],"answer":0,"exp":"They → are.","k":"51f0b9cc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["I am knowing the answer.","I know the answer.","I am studying.","I'm reading."],"answer":0,"exp":"know tidak -ing.","k":"54116705"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Mereka sedang tidak bermain\" adalah...","options":["They aren't playing.","They don't playing.","They not playing.","They isn't playing."],"answer":0,"exp":"aren't + -ing.","k":"6fbbbbb0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Apa yang sedang dia baca?\" adalah...","options":["What is she reading?","What she is reading?","What does she reading?","What is she read?"],"answer":0,"exp":"What + is + she + reading?","k":"501940fc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["every day","now","at the moment","Look!"],"answer":0,"exp":"every day = simple present.","k":"8d6e7f7e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ayah sedang mencuci mobil.","q":"Dad is ___ the car. (wash)","answers":["washing"],"hint":"wash + ing","exp":"washing.","k":"7611ace1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku sedang menulis email.","q":"I am ___ an email. (write)","answers":["writing"],"hint":"write → writ + ing","exp":"writing.","k":"649ef577"},{"type":"fill","id":"Anak itu sedang berlari.","q":"The boy is ___. (run)","answers":["running"],"hint":"run → runn + ing","exp":"running.","k":"a4a0fc99"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami sedang tidak menonton TV.","q":"We ___ watching TV.","answers":["aren't","are not"],"hint":"aren't","exp":"We → aren't.","k":"3e46c48b"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia sedang mendengarkan musik.\"","answer":"She is listening to music.","exp":"She is + listening to + music.","k":"f707f1a3"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apakah dia sedang tidur?\"","answer":"Is he sleeping?","exp":"Is + he + kata kerja-ing?","k":"0d9e51df"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang sedang terjadi?","say":"They are playing football in the park","options":["Mereka sedang bermain sepak bola di taman","Mereka bermain sepak bola setiap hari","Mereka akan bermain sepak bola","Mereka tidak bermain"],"answer":0,"exp":"are playing.","k":"45733a3a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa pertanyaannya?","say":"What are you eating","options":["Kamu sedang makan apa?","Kamu mau makan apa?","Kamu makan di mana?","Siapa yang makan?"],"answer":0,"exp":"are eating.","k":"57d85302"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Temanmu menelepon dan bertanya, \"What are you doing?\" Kamu sedang membaca. Jawabanmu?","options":["I'm reading a book.","I read a book yesterday.","I will read a book.","I reads a book."],"answer":0,"exp":"am reading.","k":"86132c03"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Ibu bertanya, \"Where is Dad?\" Ayah sedang mencuci mobil. Jawabanmu?","options":["He is washing the car.","He washed the car every day.","He wash the car.","He is wash the car."],"answer":0,"exp":"is washing.","k":"8be9e0aa"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar? (-ing)","options":["swimming","swiming","swimmming","swimeing"],"answer":0,"exp":"swimming.","k":"7ffd1067"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar? (-ing)","options":["writing","writeing","writting","writng"],"answer":0,"exp":"writing.","k":"2b13b21a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar? (-ing)","options":["running","runing","runnning","runeing"],"answer":0,"exp":"running.","k":"20421b52"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is he doing?\" (Dia belajar.)","options":["What","Who","Where is","When is"],"answer":0,"exp":"What.","k":"89193527"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ are they going?\" (Ke pasar.)","options":["Where","What","Who","How old"],"answer":0,"exp":"Where.","k":"837c63df"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is singing?\" (Rani.)","options":["Who","What","Where","When"],"answer":0,"exp":"Who.","k":"e5b2cb3f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"Look! The baby ___ crying.\"","options":["is","are","does","has"],"answer":0,"exp":"is.","k":"7b9988c2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"We ___ not watching TV now.\"","options":["are","is","do","does"],"answer":0,"exp":"are not.","k":"2492f01e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"Listen!